shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","review_id":"xFeazVnqhqZHeAUUdKJdrw","date":"2017-07-10T22:52:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9508717060089111,"text_excerpt":"Really great beignets! Comparable to what I've had at Cafe Du Monde. They come fresh to the table. Self-service on the powdered sugar though. Some that I were with liked that/some didn't. Was here as part of a tour--it was HOT outside; that could have influenced my experience. Limited menu, but looks good. Coffee au lait was excellent as well. Seating can be limited if they're busy, but it wasn't busy when we were there. Location in City Park is great."},{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","review_id":"gXOGhUMQVYrRGHHToIG0hA","date":"2013-02-09T13:32:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9473543167114258,"text_excerpt":"Ignoring the fact that we just had several donuts (for I guess breakfast?) at the relatively nearby Blue Donut, I knew I had to try some Beignets at Morning Call, one of the other main big names in town other than Cafe Du Monde. After a nice little walk through City Park that burned off the piece of strawberry that was on the top of the Peanut Butter & Jelly Donut I just had, we arrived at the misleadingly named huge Morning Call Coffee Stand. They have a similar bare bones menu as Cafe Du Monde, but the major difference here is that the beignets come served naked, and they let you powder them yourself, with each table equipped with its very own shaker of sugar. I'm definitely of favor of..."},{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","review_id":"Xw6gGPKNS1YsaTHqkTnf4w","date":"2017-04-05T19:48:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9461426138877869,"text_excerpt":"Yes I ate some beignets for the first time at Morning Call Coffee Stand. I had to see what all the hype was about. It was really good. Enough powder was on my beignet. The service was excellent and pretty fast. The waiter was also nice. What do you expect, it's in New Orleans. Everybody seems nice to me lol. It's located in City Park. Did I tell y'all I love City Park? No!? Oh ok lol"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","photo_id":"uySrAAQfS-kwLAYazO-45w","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/uySrAAQfS-kwLAYazO-45w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8133749961853027},{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","photo_id":"aN7f0NoB2ea5TJOOim2Jhg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/aN7f0NoB2ea5TJOOim2Jhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.810039758682251},{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","photo_id":"T83YLWxxQx9YwK7Df1lXYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/T83YLWxxQx9YwK7Df1lXYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8025377988815308},{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","photo_id":"GmhuMUmmsD5AU9dkV-aDAQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GmhuMUmmsD5AU9dkV-aDAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7718871831893921},{"business_id":"PVieWiYn8GK9GSLnNFmOyA","photo_id":"rOf3SQHpdsOLbOX1WvkWeQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rOf3SQHpdsOLbOX1WvkWeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7522035241127014}]},"no